<title>USA: FNB Corp Q4 profits rise.</title>
<headline>FNB Corp Q4 profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>HERMITAGE, Pa. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.59		    $0.51</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.57		    $0.49</p>
<p> Net			  5,645		    4,898</p>
<p> Net interest Inc	20,507		   19,449</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings are before SAIF assessment and merger costs. Including the items, the company earned about $4,987,000 or $0.52 a share primary, $0.50 a share fully diluted.  </p>
<p>		   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.21		    $1.90</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.10		    $1.81</p>
<p> Net			 21,018		   18,083</p>
<p> Net interest inc	80,744		   77,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings are before SAIF assessment and merger costs. Including the items, the company earned $18.4 million for the year or $1.93 a share primary, $1.84 a share fully diluted.</p>
